#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0516 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0516 (SDTMIG 3.3/3.4), Condition \"Study does not use multi-stage arm assignments and ARMCD ^= null\", Rule \"ARMCD in TA.ARMCD\". The fixture models a single-stage study (one randomisation, every arm fully defined in TA), so the Condition's multi-stage clause holds and every flagged row is an authority violation (Partially Executable: that clause is not evaluated, status file P0-4). Row 2: ARMCD=C is not a TA.ARMCD -> fires. Row 3: ARMCD=SCRNFAIL is populated and not a TA.ARMCD; CG0516 has no exemption list (SDTMIG 3.3+ models screen failures with a null ARMCD and ARMNRS) -> fires. Row 1 matches TA; row 4 has a null ARMCD -> silent. This S2 is also the S3 foreign discriminator (SKELETON-distinct-function hazard 3): a port reading ARMCD from DM instead of TA would put each row's own ARMCD in the set and never fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=2 USUBJID=S-002 ARMCD=C
#expectViolationAt row=3 USUBJID=S-003 ARMCD=SCRNFAIL
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD    type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM      type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
col ARMNRS   type=Char label="Reason Arm and/or Actual Arm is Null"
---
STUDY01 | DM | S-001 | A        | Drug A         | A | Drug A |
STUDY01 | DM | S-002 | C        | Drug C         | C | Drug C |
STUDY01 | DM | S-003 | SCRNFAIL | Screen Failure |   |        | SCREEN FAILURE
STUDY01 | DM | S-004 |          |                |   |        | NOT ASSIGNED
---

dataset TA label="Trial Arms"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM     type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col TAETORD type=Num  label="Planned Order of Element within Arm"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col EPOCH   type=Char label="Epoch"
---
STUDY01 | TA | A | Drug A | 1 | SCRN | Screening | SCREENING
STUDY01 | TA | A | Drug A | 2 | DRGA | Drug A    | TREATMENT
STUDY01 | TA | B | Drug B | 1 | SCRN | Screening | SCREENING
STUDY01 | TA | B | Drug B | 2 | DRGB | Drug B    | TREATMENT
---
